  "Coinbase y Privy son marcas registradas de sus respectivos titulares y operan como proveedores independientes de Bóveda Market (compra y retiro de fondos, y acceso con autocustodia). El uso de sus nombres y logotipos no implica patrocinio ni respaldo directo.": "Coinbase and Privy are registered trademarks of their respective owners and act as independent providers to Bóveda Market (buying and withdrawing funds, and self-custody sign-in). Use of their names and logos does not imply sponsorship or direct endorsement.",
